  "thought": "Cluster-first route-second heuristic: assign customers to trucks using a farthest-insertion strategy that minimizes the increase in maximum route distance. Then improve via intra-route 2-opt and inter-route relocate moves, always focusing on balancing route lengths. Deterministic tie-breaking by customer index."
